      "source": "人教版《化学·选择性必修1》第三章'水溶液中的离子反应与平衡'",
      "problemText": "向 AgCl 白色沉淀悬浊液中加入 KI 溶液，沉淀转为黄色（AgI）。写出转化方程式，用 Ksp(AgCl) 与 Ksp(AgI) 表达转化平衡常数 K 并判断转化能否发生（K = Ksp(原)/Ksp(新)）。",
      "given": {
        "solution": {
          "solutes": [
            { "species": "AgCl", "concentration": "0.1", "volumeLiters": "1" }
          ],
          "conversion": { "original": "AgCl", "addedIon": "I^-", "target": "AgI" }
        }
      },
      "question": { "ask": "WriteProducts", "targets": ["沉淀转化方程式", "K 表达式与方向判断"] },
      "expected": {
        "equations": ["AgCl + I^- = AgI↓ + Cl^-"],
        "aqueous": {
          "order": [],
          "conservationEquations": [
            "Ksp(AgCl) = c(Ag^+)·c(Cl^-)",
            "Ksp(AgI) = c(Ag^+)·c(I^-)"
          ]
        }
